<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Moody's lifts Victoria, W. Australia outlooks.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Moody's lifts Victoria, W. Australia outlooks.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday that it had revised the outlook for the foreign currency debt rating of the Australian states of Victoria and Western Australia to improving from stable.</p>
</text>
